third-party models. It does not vendor or import their original code, but
their weights and architectures carry their own separate license terms.

## SAM 3.1

Checkpoint weights are Meta's, under Meta's own "SAM License"
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3), not Apache/MIT. Obligations
independent of this project's own license: attribution in any publication of
results, and compliance with Trade Controls/export regulations.

## GVHMR

Licensed by Zhejiang University for educational, research, and non-profit
